hs since they started dating, but Yui and Naoya still weren’t used to being a couple. Just then, a man passing by called out to them. <i>“Yui-chan?”</i> At that moment, Yui was speechless. Standing there was the man who had been her first. Before they started dating, driven by curiosity about sex, Yui had slept with him. The man threatens to reveal her past actions to her boyfriend. And so, once again, Yui finds herself harboring a secret she can't tell her boyfriend…\n<br><br>\n(Source: PinkPineapple, translated)","duration":30,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Hentai"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":59,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",173818,null,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"source":"DOUJINSHI","startDate":{"day":26,"month":6,"year":2026},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":5,"score":10},{"amount":3,"score":20},{"amount":7,"score":30},{"amount":13,"score":40},{"amount":12,"score":50},{"amount":25,"score":60},{"amount":22,"score":70},{"amount":9,"score":80},{"amount":11,"score":90},{"amount":8,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":136,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":224,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":114,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":18,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":44,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"RELEASING","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[[45,"Pink Pineapple",false,true],[7213,"Shion",true,true]],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":null,"native":"彼の知らない秘密を入れて。 The Animation","romaji":"Kare no Shiranai Himitsu wo Irete. The Animation"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793697009},"64154":{"al":212105,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#e4d6ae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b212105-f5L7q8C22ga2.png"},"description":"Umiko, a grandma, realizes that she has the same desire to make movies as university student Kai—and soon she enrolls in Kai's film school!\n<br><br>\n<i>\"It's not the movies you like…you like watching the people watching the movies.\"</i>\n<br><br>\nJust what are you going to do with the rest of your life? It's the question you'll always have to answer, no matter your age. Umiko Chino is a 65-year-old retired woman in mourning for her late husband. Remembering how they used to watch films together, Umiko goes to the movie theater for the first time in years, where she meets Kai, an attractive, ambiguous young man who studies filmmaking at a nearby art school.\n<br><br>\nThey would seem to have nothing in common, except for this—both of them sometimes like to look more at the way the audience reacts to a movie than the movie itself. Kai believes Umiko has the same deep desire he possesses to experience how people respond to something they made… and challenges her to stake the rest of her life discovering that thrill.\n<br><br>\nSoon Umiko surprises herself by enrolling in the same film school as Kai. But sailing into this new sea, she's suddenly inside the currents of her fellow students' lives, a much younger generation that she struggles to understand, driven by their own passions and their own relationships. Who's really experienced at life, and is it old age or observation that brings wisdom? And does what you're looking for change when you look with your eyes instead of through a camera lens…?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Dark Horse)","duration":null,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://x.com/umiendrollmovie"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"https://www.kyotoanimation.co.jp/works/umiendroll/"}],"genres":["Comedy","Drama","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":"#海が走るエンドロール #TheCreditsRollIntoTheSea","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":null,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"MOVIE","rank":11,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year